<title>HUNGARY: Hungary forint ends weaker vs dollar in slow mkt.</title>
<headline>Hungary forint ends weaker vs dollar in slow mkt.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hungarian forint ended weaker on Monday, with London and Tokyo closed and a strengthening of the dollar against the mark coming after the close, dealers said.</p>
<p>The forint ended at 182.40/45 to the dollar, compared with 182.24/29 in early trade and 182.23/26 at midday.</p>
<p>The forint floats against a basket made up 30 percent of the dollar and 70 percent of the mark.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
